What:           /sys/class/qcom-battery/bypass_charging_enable
Date:           November 2026
Contact:        DirhamTzy <triyadidirham@users.noreply.github.com>
Description:
                Read/write control for Xiaomi firmware scene-based bypass.
                Write 1 to request bypass and 0 to restore normal charging.

                Enabling runs the selected SMART_CHG scene sequence:
                  scene - 1, then 3
                Disabling runs:
                  scene - 2, then 2
                The previous fast-charge SMART_CHG/SPORT_MODE state is saved
                on entry and restored after bypass is disabled.

                Reads return 0 or 1 for the last confirmed state and append
                "-pending" while the asynchronous sequence is in progress.
                A successful state transition confirms firmware scene
                selection; electrical bypass must still be validated using
                battery current and capacity telemetry on the device.

What:           /sys/class/qcom-battery/bypass_charging_mode
Date:           November 2026
Contact:        DirhamTzy <triyadidirham@users.noreply.github.com>
Description:
                Selects the SMART_CHG thermal scene used by the next bypass
                activation. Accepted names and indices are:
                  0 / navigation
                  1 / tgame
                  2 / nolimit

                Reading lists all modes and encloses the selected mode in
                brackets. Changing the selector while bypass is active does
                not alter the scene latched for the current transition.
